/* 我的（Figma 643:932）：竹林 hero + 头像与衬线昵称；登录卡（未登录时唯一实心按钮）；四个 GroupRow 分组；研究者登录。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.profile-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.profile-hero {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.profile-hero__sky {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  background: var(--p3-mist);
}

.profile-hero__art {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 190px;
}

.profile-hero__user {
  position: absolute;
  left: 48rpx;
  right: 48rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 32rpx;
}

.profile-hero__avatar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 128rpx;
  height: 128rpx;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  box-shadow: var(--p3-shadow-float);
}

.profile-hero__copy {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

/* 昵称可能是用户自己填的，用系统衬线，避免一行里混用子集字体。 */
.profile-hero__name {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif-open);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.profile-hero__meta {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.profile-hero__pill {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
}

.profile-content {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) 56rpx;
}

.profile-account__title {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 40rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.profile-account__body,
.profile-account__note {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.profile-account__boundary {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.profile-account__actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.profile-account__actions .p3-btn {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.profile-account__logout {
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

.profile-identity {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.profile-identity__row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  min-height: 88rpx;
}

.profile-identity__label {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 30rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.profile-identity__state {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.profile-identity__action {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: auto;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 0 0 0 16rpx;
  color: var(--p3-risk-ink);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.profile-identity__divider {
  height: 2rpx;
  background: var(--p3-hairline);
}

.profile-claim__modules {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12rpx;
}

.profile-claim__module {
  padding: 4rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-mist);
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.profile-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.profile-row {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.profile-footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

.profile-footer .p3-link {
  width: auto;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
}
